          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi ana a chilume a Sauli kala ni Jonathani, Ishivi na Maliki-Shua. Na anae airi achetu, wa kpwandza kala aihwa Merabu na mdidewe kala anaihwa Mikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mkpwaza Sauli waihwa Ahinoamu, mwana mchetu wa Ahimaazi. Alafu mkpwulu wa jeshire waihwa Abineri, mwana wa Neri. Neri kala ni ise mdide wa Sauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kishi isengbwa wa Sauli na Neri isengbwa wa Abineri kala ni anangbwa a Abieli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.51"
            ]
          }
        }
